@block heading
{secretary.organisation}
REGIONAL SERVICES COMMITTEE
Minutes of the meeting held on 9 September

@block body
Present:
{chair.full_name}, {chair.title} (Chair)
{secretary.full_name}, {secretary.title} (Secretary)
{member_a.full_name}, {member_a.title}
{member_b.full_name}, {member_b.title}

Regrets: none.

@block heading
1. Minutes of the previous meeting

@block body
The minutes of 12 August were approved without amendment.

@block heading
2. Delegation

@block body
The Committee received {delegate.full_name} of {delegate.town}, who attended at the
Committee's invitation to speak about access to services in the region.
{delegate.given_name} described a six-week wait for an assessment and provided a written
submission, which is appended. {delegate.given_name} gave a contact address of
{delegate.home_address} and asked to be told the outcome. The Chair thanked
{delegate.full_name} and the delegation withdrew.

@block heading
3. Correspondence

@block body
{secretary.given_name} reported that an access to information request had been received
from {requester.full_name} (file {requester.file_number}) for the Committee's records for
the previous two years. {member_a.given_name} asked whether the delegation's submission
fell within the request. The Secretary undertook to seek advice.

@block heading
4. Any other business

@block body
{member_b.given_name} noted that the regional office telephone number published on the
Department's website is out of date and should read {member_b.work_phone}.

The meeting closed at 11:40. The next meeting will be held on 14 October.

@block signature
Minutes taken by {secretary.full_name}, {secretary.title}
Approved by {chair.full_name}, {chair.title}
